# Downloaded corpora, converted audio, and manifests. Three exceptions, all
# INPUTS to a published benchmark number rather than derivable outputs — and all
# three are things CI must be able to read:
#
#   hotwords-vi.txt                    48 generated lines, without which
#                                      results/ is not reproducible
#   display-itn-holdout-approved.jsonl a record of a HUMAN judgement on 50
#                                      held-out utterances. Regenerating it from
#                                      the current code would silently re-approve
#                                      whatever the code now does, which is
#                                      exactly the failure it exists to prevent
#   itn-roundtrip.jsonl                hand-written held-out recall set; it is
#                                      the only recall evidence English has
data/*
!data/hotwords-vi.txt
!data/display-itn-holdout-approved.jsonl
!data/itn-roundtrip.jsonl
# Downloaded model weights (Phase 2)
models/
# Per-run raw metrics (results/**/*.jsonl) stay tracked as the evidence behind
# the report tables; generated audio does not.
results/**/*.wav
# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
